===persian===

من درختم
زرد خورشید
آبی آب
سبز بی‌تاب
و
برگ برگ چشم‌هایم
پُر از شوقی ناب...
۱۳۷۵/۸

===machine===

I am a tree —
the yellow of the sun,
the blue of water,
restless green,
and
leaf by leaf my eyes
full of a pure longing...
1375/8

===lantern===



===translation===

The tree
in me
(is) chafing green
sun-glowed yellow
& watery blue

Leaf by leaf
my eyes swollen
with
raw ardor...

===footnotes===

chafe attempts to merge the dual etymologies of بی‌تاب - of heat and fidgeting 
